7-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkgte.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Practical Organic Chemistry Question 5 Hindi Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mobqkh9k/09f2759d-ac9b-4295-b529-b3012d2aefea/1eb6be80-3f37-11f1-8907-9d59f06ca3d8/file-jaoe38c1mobqkh9l.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>2-मेथिलप्रोपीन (2-Methylpropene) अध्रुवीय है। यह सिलिका जेल के सा